				<vpumlModel id="yxX60.mD.AAAAdQG" modelType="UserStoryStatus">
					<properties>
						<property name="name" type="string" value="Done"/>
						<property name="modelType" type="string" value="UserStoryStatus"/>
						<property htmlValue="&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;    &#10;  &lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;      A user story that has been implemented and has fulfilled its acceptance criteria. In sprint review, the product owner inspects the work the team has done and if he/she agrees it meets the acceptance criteria. If the result is positive, the user story is said to be &lt;b&gt;Done&lt;/b&gt;.    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;" name="documentation" type="htmlString" value="A user story that has been implemented and has fulfilled its acceptance criteria. In sprint review, the product owner inspects the work the team has done and if he/she agrees it meets the acceptance criteria. If the result is positive, the user story is said to be Done."/>
						<property name="pmCreateDateTime" type="string" value="1751463741825"/>
						<property name="pmLastModified" type="string" value="1751468489556"/>
