						<property htmlValue="&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;    &#10;  &lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;      A user story is deemed incomplete when the definition of done for the story was incomplete, or when the acceptance criteria for the story is not met. In general, the story is incomplete even if one acceptance criteria is not met.    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;" name="documentation" type="htmlString" value="A user story is deemed incomplete when the definition of done for the story was incomplete, or when the acceptance criteria for the story is not met. In general, the story is incomplete even if one acceptance criteria is not met."/>
