				<ownedComment annotatedElement="52zC8lmGAqACEA19" xmi:id="52zC8lmGAqACEA19_documentaiton" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
					<body>Questo caso d'uso permette a un Produttore autenticato di creare e aggiornare le informazioni relative alla propria azienda, come il nome, l'indirizzo e le coordinate geografiche. Questa è un'operazione fondamentale per poter successivamente aggiungere prodotti.</body>
					<xmi:Extension extender="Visual Paradigm">
						<htmlValue value="&lt;head&gt;&#10;    &lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;!--&#10;        body { color: #000000; font-family: Dialog; font-size: 12px }&#10;      --&gt;&#10;    &lt;/style&gt;&#10;    &#10;  &lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;      &lt;span charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot; display=&quot;inline !important&quot; float=&quot;none&quot; font-style=&quot;normal&quot; letter-spacing=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:400;font-size:medium;font-family:-webkit-standard;text-align:start;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; text-indent=&quot;0px&quot; text-transform=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;normal&quot; word-spacing=&quot;0px&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;-webkit-standard&quot; size=&quot;medium&quot; style=&quot;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size:medium;&quot;&gt;Questo &#10;      caso d'uso permette a un&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;-webkit-standard&quot; size=&quot;medium&quot; style=&quot;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size:medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;code font-style=&quot;normal&quot; letter-spacing=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:400;text-align:start;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; text-indent=&quot;0px&quot; text-transform=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;normal&quot; word-spacing=&quot;0px&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Produttore&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;-webkit-standard&quot; size=&quot;medium&quot; style=&quot;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size:medium;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;-webkit-standard&quot; size=&quot;medium&quot; style=&quot;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size:medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;span display=&quot;inline !important&quot; float=&quot;none&quot; font-style=&quot;normal&quot; letter-spacing=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quo