ne;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; size=&quot;11pt&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;Il &#13;&#10;          progetto deve essere sviluppato in Java e successivamente portato su &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; size=&quot;11pt&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span font-style=&quot;normal&quot; font-variant=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-weight:700;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Spring &#13;&#10;          Boot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span font-style=&quot;normal&quot; font-variant=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-weight:400;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;pre-wrap&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&#13;&#10;        &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; font-style=&quot;normal&quot; font-variant=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;list-style-type:disc;font-weight:400;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;pre&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;        &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; line-height=&quot;1.38&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;          &lt;span font-style=&quot;normal&quot; font-variant=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-weight:400;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; size=&quot;11pt&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;Lo &#13;&#10;          strato di presentazione pu&amp;#242; essere sviluppato con strumenti a scelta &#13;&#10;          dello studente ed eventualmente pu&amp;#242; limitarsi alla linea di comando &#13;&#10;          e/o API REST.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;        &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; font-style=&quot;normal&quot; font-variant=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;list-style-type:disc;font-weight:400;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;pre&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;        &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; line-height=&quot;1.38&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:12pt;&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;          &lt;span font-style=&quot;normal&quot; font-variant=&quot;normal&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-weight:400;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;&quot; text-decoration=&quot;none&quot; white-space=&quot;pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial,sans-serif&quot; size=&quot;11pt&quot; style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;Si &#13;&#10;          raccomanda di utilizzare almeno due design pattern (diverso dal &#13;&#10;          Singleton).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;        &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &amp;nbsp;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;"/>
